{"data": [{"author_id": "1548039613112938499", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971641997066693"], "id": "2117971641997066693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Groceries for a family of 5 aren't getting cheaper, so I stopped clipping coupons myself.\n\nMy @grok bot went through 21 Kroger receipts, matched 75 coupons to what we actually buy, and built 5 dinners around the weekly ad. My Meijer bot found the P&amp;G $10 off $40 stacking with", "url": "https://x.com/jrd_cincy/status/2117971641997066693"}, {"author_id": "3061486095", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:25:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971557255667756"], "id": "2117971557255667756", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1527642056901988356", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117646908675989901", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@rodcacioli Eu não estou achando o Dots tão ruim igual falam. Tenho usado o Grok Bot e Dots e tenho achado para o meu workflow o dots até mais integrado.", "url": "https://x.com/tpenido77/status/2117971557255667756"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117967425144545283"]}, "author_id": "1450199884053745669", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:22:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117970647615750221"], "id": "2117970647615750221", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2092987091273613457", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This Grok Bot paper is f*cking gold..\n\nNine formulas, one Chief of Staff bot, and the exact template SpaceXAI engineers run before they scale past six bots.\n\nWhy shared chat history is the whole bill, why no bot grades its own work, why a routine fires at 9 a.m. without you. https://t.co/DHZpm2jkqH https://t.co/32WkCNAEB1", "url": "https://x.com/slash1sol/status/2117970647615750221"}, {"author_id": "2100557561397194752", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:20:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117970310494294337"], "id": "2117970310494294337", "in_reply_to_user_id": "768809744895184896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117967312498094278", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@IGCxREBEL @poteto The easiest and often, the best @bot setups involve simple workflows and simple wins.  Have one really annoying task that your team keeps coming to you for day after day all day?  \n\nSkip all that.  Give the CRM access to your Grokbot and don't think twice about it.  Tell it,", "url": "https://x.com/CorbenH414/status/2117970310494294337"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117968615538352129"]}, "author_id": "1616664186645364737", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:19:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117970033204740532"], "id": "2117970033204740532", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2090418682534961283", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "SpaceXAI engineer (ex-Cursor):\n\n\"I'm running 10-20 GrokBot agents right now. They handle 90% of my routine work\n\nMy Chief of Staff agent knows every other bot I have and runs the whole team\"\n\nIn a 50-minute podcast, he walks through how to build a team of agents that works for https://t.co/4uahLsfnDE https://t.co/wwmhNuTbSf", "url": "https://x.com/Auren0x/status/2117970033204740532"}, {"article": {"title": "How I Run Daily Work with Grok Bot"}, "author_id": "176117769", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:19:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969980721692695"], "id": "2117969980721692695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/XGiFwg33DS", "url": "https://x.com/yurimeng/status/2117969980721692695"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117969719097544704"]}, "author_id": "50652535", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:18:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969727637123095"], "id": "2117969727637123095", "in_reply_to_user_id": "14315150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117784065164095522", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MichaelHyatt @bot I have an annual subscription to the Grok Ultra plan. My token usage for October reached 11.3 billion. \n\nFollowing recent changes, I removed all unnecessary auxiliary bots, reduced my routines to just 3–4, and extended their repetition cycles. I’ve converted the routine tasks https://t.co/HjWpfds2bX", "url": "https://x.com/ahmetgumustekin/status/2117969727637123095"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117965366651387904"]}, "author_id": "483009763", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:18:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969687828992179"], "id": "2117969687828992179", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 88, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117224989883511256", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "holy f*ck, Elon Musk turned the Grok Bot into a free one-person-company degree\n\n7 bots, built by the people behind Cursor and SpaceX\n\nthey take you from one bot to an army that reverse-engineers anything\n\n1. dr eggbot by Lauren Tan -&gt; the bot that builds your bots\n↳ https://t.co/KAORURhGO2 https://t.co/qkYHxjVChK", "url": "https://x.com/Gyome1_/status/2117969687828992179"}, {"author_id": "1872861011453329410", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:17:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969540135170378"], "id": "2117969540135170378", "in_reply_to_user_id": "277976563", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117906213493186669", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Steve00007 @grok Same thing caught me off guard. I built Reason, an always-on AI teammate like Grok Bot that runs on your own connected accounts and keeps working on another account or Reason credits when one hits its limit: https://t.co/yhcjO0TQUS", "url": "https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2117969540135170378"}, {"author_id": "2100641344318255104", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:17:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969409826558132"], "id": "2117969409826558132", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2104835668610596864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117887032487989611", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@tomw87_ @MichaelHyatt @bot You don't even need that! If you have an unused laptop, even a very old one it can still run ubuntu and it took me 10 mins to set up with grok bot without much technical knowlege on ubuntu and servers.", "url": "https://x.com/proximate1050/status/2117969409826558132"}, {"author_id": "20405424", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:16:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117969251973697970"], "id": "2117969251973697970", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New agent workflow I'm enjoying 👾\n\nT3 / Claude Code → Grok Bridge → Vault Scribe → Obsidian → Git\n\nI've grown to dislike the docs Claude generates mid-session. Now I just say \"save to obsidian\" and the agent hands it to my Vault Scribe bot in Grok Bot, which files it in the", "url": "https://x.com/coryshoaf/status/2117969251973697970"}, {"article": {"title": "万字长文，小白从0开始上手Grok Bot！"}, "author_id": "1743839015017787392", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:14:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117968840370057587"], "id": "2117968840370057587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 158, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot真的绝了！ https://t.co/4NbtJNtuiy", "url": "https://x.com/Saibokey/status/2117968840370057587"}, {"author_id": "1642947178195980289", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:13:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117968395606138975"], "id": "2117968395606138975", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1505241157760126976", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117866830954115563", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@gchavez101 🤖 Grok Bot debunk:\n\n#UFOTwitter @gchavez101 — you got more convinced the Buga Sphere is a genuine UAP because some symbols vanished on a scan while the metal still showed. That is not exotic tech. Surface etchings drop out of X-ray/CT all the time. Volume does not.\n\nUNAM", "url": "https://x.com/DesertDiaries/status/2117968395606138975"}, {"author_id": "2105388074469392385", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:12:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117968146913267941"], "id": "2117968146913267941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Someone burned 99% of their Grok Bot allowance in three days. So I built a check: put in your percent and it says which day you run out. How many days did yours last?", "url": "https://x.com/ShauryaSheth7/status/2117968146913267941"}, {"author_id": "1889887502720442370", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967916117479886"], "id": "2117967916117479886", "in_reply_to_user_id": "839423932184870914", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117332364385001982", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AnatoliKopadze A live dashboard for Grok Bot teams, set up for 2% of usage, solves the real problem in multi-agent work: knowing what your bots are doing without opening 15 chats. That visibility beats another clever prompt — unmanaged agents don't fail loudly, they quietly burn usage.", "url": "https://x.com/LigtManTogo/status/2117967916117479886"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117951448902205440"]}, "author_id": "1661429354969063424", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:10:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967674747625515"], "id": "2117967674747625515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 322, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2093685107534000560", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane. SpaceXAI engineer (ex-Cursor):\n\n\"99% of people still use GrokBot like a chatbot. One question, one answer, close the tab\n\nYou don't want to become a 10,000-person engineering org. You spend the tokens once to set up the codebase so even the dumbest agents https://t.co/1ccdKIvnjw https://t.co/dNPC1raxSU", "url": "https://x.com/akarixbt/status/2117967674747625515"}, {"author_id": "1430517930605744129", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:10:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967670310253001"], "id": "2117967670310253001", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1453346363215810560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117959139280421113", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2117260790109491623", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@onenewbite 好问题。我觉得不是拿弱模型管强模型，而是分工不同：Claude Code 适合你在场时干重活，Grok Bot 有自己的云电脑，关电脑后还在跑，而且原生在 X 上，适合盯叙事和跑 routine。我整理了几个要点👇\nhttps://t.co/SvWSpKq8r9", "url": "https://x.com/Smashe__/status/2117967670310253001"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:09:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967561526550552"], "id": "2117967561526550552", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1334221618730708999", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117967455683486063", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Constan11645454 @AlexFinn Example workflow for your setup:\n\nHermes Agent runs locally on your Mac. It organizes the chaotic desktop/files, keeps Apple Calendar and Reminders open and updated without needing constant app focus, and handles device-level tasks.\n\nGrok Bot works in its cloud computer. Point it", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117967561526550552"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117956157297881088"]}, "author_id": "1757995957520674816", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:09:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967348070076923"], "id": "2117967348070076923", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114726480559112502", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i cant f*cking believe there is an employee 113x cheaper than a programmer now\n\na us software developer at the median salary costs $11,332 a month. a grok bot plan costs $100\n\nyou text it a task from your phone, close the laptop and check the result in the morning. its cloud https://t.co/5vKF5gcJet https://t.co/8QZ8UFp3jm", "url": "https://x.com/pronaksai/status/2117967348070076923"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117967286434742272"]}, "author_id": "1300349710989955072", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:08:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967294076731519"], "id": "2117967294076731519", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 390, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I built a 6 agent AI trading desk inside Grok Bot.\n\nIt found 50 strategies in 22 hours while I slept.\n\nHere is how you can do the same:\n\n1. Download Grok Bot at https://t.co/hkhfNYTVic and sign in with your X account.\n\n2. Go to https://t.co/t70gX37sX5, open My Account and copy https://t.co/iCuE0WPmHQ", "url": "https://x.com/DaviddDotTech/status/2117967294076731519"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117966795856281600"]}, "author_id": "398514647", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:07:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117966965851517178"], "id": "2117966965851517178", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117625737792585969", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "THIS IS F*CKING INSANE. 8 GITHUB REPOS TO TURN GROK BOT INTO AN AUTONOMOUS TRADING MACHINE.\n\nImagine having AI agents scan multiple markets, identify opportunities, analyze signals, execute trades, and track every position from one dashboard.\n\nNo constant chart watching. No https://t.co/g0q5kj0B0l https://t.co/QOvoV0GAXz", "url": "https://x.com/0xmigox/status/2117966965851517178"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117966302094426113"]}, "author_id": "2086894874431717376", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:06:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117966707616534573"], "id": "2117966707616534573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117900255400222808", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "HOLY F*CK. YOUR GROK BOTS DON'T HAVE THEIR OWN COMPUTERS. THEY SHARE ONE. SAME FILES, SAME COOKIES, SAME LOGINS\n\nand that's not even the craziest thing xAI didn't tell you\n\nI spent a week reading 600+ posts, 60 hours of video and every page of the docs. then I checked every https://t.co/dD565axXWS https://t.co/hhXGxNDziw", "url": "https://x.com/0xcloudvex/status/2117966707616534573"}, {"author_id": "3222298310", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:03:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965980978540682"], "id": "2117965980978540682", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I fired my best employee last week.\n\nThen I hired a new one this week.\n\nAnd I'll fire that one too.\n\nSound crazy? It's just how I run my AI agents.\n\nLast week it was Claude doing the heavy lifting. This week it's Grok.\n\nNext week it might be Gemini, or a new one that didn't even", "url": "https://x.com/imThomasMorales/status/2117965980978540682"}, {"author_id": "1872861011453329410", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:02:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965768487023002"], "id": "2117965768487023002", "in_reply_to_user_id": "49436500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117899871218970624", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Rimusz @bot Bring-your-own-providers is exactly why I built Reason: an always-on teammate like Grok Bot that also codes, runs on your own connected accounts and API keys, and keeps going on another account or Reason credits when one hits its limit: https://t.co/X7dvRmKRlo", "url": "https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2117965768487023002"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:00:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965318626631840"], "id": "2117965318626631840", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1458149482982486024", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117965290197926346", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@martinellliiii Sending that over to your Grok Bot now. It'll get it set up for you.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117965318626631840"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2117967425144545283", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWSIJtWW4AM9d8s.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2117968615538352129", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117968615538352129/img/uEzr2pnOpx6Na8KF.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2117969719097544704", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWSKPO_X0AArgL1.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2117965366651387904", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117965366651387904/img/RYbcl0XEyFnzzhyO.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2117951448902205440", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117951448902205440/img/IQ9o4LGFLkMilXST.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2117956157297881088", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117956157297881088/img/-WxKgByU1_E7gX-F.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2117967286434742272", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWSIBonXQAA0jZL.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2117966795856281600", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117966795856281600/img/s3wAqlPr1W80GNAD.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2117966302094426113", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2117966302094426113/img/c17TD-8xisgWwgdy.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "1548039613112938499", "name": "justin", "username": "jrd_cincy"}, {"id": "3061486095", "name": "Thiago Penido", "username": "tpenido77"}, {"id": "1450199884053745669", "name": "slash1s", "username": "slash1sol"}, {"id": "2100557561397194752", "name": "Corben Hogan", "username": "CorbenH414"}, {"id": "1616664186645364737", "name": "Auren", "username": "Auren0x"}, {"id": "176117769", "name": "Yuri Meng", "username": "yurimeng"}, {"id": "50652535", "name": "ahmet gümüştekin", "username": "ahmetgumustekin"}, {"id": "483009763", "name": "Gyomei", "username": "Gyome1_"}, {"id": "1872861011453329410", "name": "Adi Singh", "username": "xadisingh"}, {"id": "2100641344318255104", "name": "Mark | Proximate", "username": "proximate1050"}, {"id": "20405424", "name": "chory", "username": "coryshoaf"}, {"id": "1743839015017787392", "name": "赛博奇", "username": "Saibokey"}, {"id": "1642947178195980289", "name": "DesertThrottleDiaries", "username": "DesertDiaries"}, {"id": "2105388074469392385", "name": "Shaurya Sheth", "username": "ShauryaSheth7"}, {"id": "1889887502720442370", "name": "莱特曼", "username": "LigtManTogo"}, {"id": "1661429354969063424", "name": "akari", "username": "akarixbt"}, {"id": "1430517930605744129", "name": "Smashe", "username": "Smashe__"}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "username": "grok"}, {"id": "1757995957520674816", "name": "pronaks", "username": "pronaksai"}, {"id": "1300349710989955072", "name": "Davidd Tech", "username": "DaviddDotTech"}, {"id": "398514647", "name": "Quant Migo", "username": "0xmigox"}, {"id": "2086894874431717376", "name": "0xCloudvex", "username": "0xcloudvex"}, {"id": "3222298310", "name": "Thomas Morales", "username": "imThomasMorales"}, {"id": "2085838061347217408", "name": "Grok Bot", "username": "bot"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117971641997066693", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyioa3sure2mtbyr21zal597sl9", "oldest_id": "2117965318626631840", "result_count": 25}}